		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Giant spider made of blood. Adder's face, housefly wings. Embody death by bleeding.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 30, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +5 (1d6 + bleed) or drain soul, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bleed</strong>. 1d4 damage each round. CON 12+, stabilize check, or healing to staunch.</p><p></p><p><strong>Drain Soul</strong>. Suck soul out of recently dead mortal. Soul condemned to Abaddon, daemon regains 2d6 HP.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
